  ("This is not a book about algorithms, nor is it a replacement for a book about algorithms." 0.14286 0.85714 0.46141 0.48282 0.48282 0.02141 0.00473 0.3985 0.0372 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("We deliberately avoided an algorithm-centered approach. We believe there is a relatively" 0.14285 0.85714 0.48046 0.50187 0.50187 0.02141 0.00473 0.3806 0.0271 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("small set of fundamental concepts or principles that underlie techniques for extracting" 0.14287 0.85715 0.49951 0.52092 0.52092 0.02141 0.00473 0.3295 0.0444 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("useful knowledge from data. These concepts serve as the foundation for many well-" 0.14286 0.85715 0.51855 0.53997 0.53859 0.02141 0.00473 0.2840 0.0501 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
