  ("data-centered business problems, the creation and evaluation of data science solutions," 0.14285 0.85713 0.55665 0.57806 0.57806 0.02141 0.00473 0.3073 0.1141 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("and the evaluation of general data science strategies and proposals. Accordingly, we" 0.14286 0.85715 0.5757 0.59711 0.59711 0.02141 0.00473 0.2482 0.0315 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("organized the exposition around these general principles rather than around specific" 0.14286 0.85714 0.59474 0.61616 0.61616 0.02141 0.00473 0.2450 0.0828 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
