  ("text and diagrams, which we think are more accessible than a listing of detailed algo‐" 0.14287 0.85715 0.63284 0.65425 0.65425 0.02141 0.00473 0.3238 0.0314 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("rithmic steps." 0.14286 0.25601 0.65189 0.6733 0.6733 0.02141 0.00473 0.3770 0.0622 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("The book does not presume a sophisticated mathematical background. However, by its" 0.14286 0.85715 0.68 0.70142 0.70142 0.02141 0.00473 0.3545 0.0328 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("very nature the material is somewhat technical—the goal is to impart a significant un‐" 0.14285 0.85714 0.69905 0.72047 0.72047 0.02141 0.00473 0.3681 0.0364 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("derstanding of data science, not just to give a high-level overview. In general, we have" 0.14285 0.85713 0.7181 0.73951 0.73951 0.02141 0.00473 0.2934 0.0998 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("tried to minimize the mathematics and make the exposition as “conceptual” as possible." 0.14286 0.85715 0.73715 0.75856 0.75856 0.02141 0.00473 0.3931 0.0395 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("Colleagues in industry comment that the book is invaluable for helping to align the" 0.14286 0.85714 0.76527 0.78668 0.78668 0.02141 0.00473 0.2966 0.0903 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
