  ("pamphlet “Cliff’s Notes to Interviewing for Data Science Jobs.”)" 0.14286 0.66848 0.24051 0.26193 0.26193 0.02141 0.00473 0.3666 0.0793 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("Our Conceptual Approach to Data Science" 0.14285 0.64678 0.27678 0.31104 0.31104 0.03426 0.00593 0.2884 0.0442 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" 0.0286 t nil 0 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" t)
  ("In this book we introduce a collection of the most important fundamental concepts of" 0.14285 0.85645 0.31753 0.33894 0.33894 0.02141 0.00473 0.3440 0.0185 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("data science. Some of these concepts are “headliners” for chapters, and others are in‐" 0.14285 0.85713 0.33658 0.35799 0.35799 0.02141 0.00473 0.2653 0.0352 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("troduced more naturally through the discussions (and thus they are not necessarily" 0.14286 0.85715 0.35562 0.37704 0.37704 0.02141 0.00473 0.2417 0.0754 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("labeled as fundamental concepts). The concepts span the process from envisioning the" 0.14286 0.85714 0.37467 0.39608 0.39608 0.02141 0.00473 0.3233 0.0590 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("problem, to applying data science techniques, to deploying the results to improve" 0.14285 0.85714 0.39372 0.41513 0.41513 0.02141 0.00473 0.2624 0.0758 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("decision-making. The concepts also undergird a large array of business analytics meth‐" 0.14287 0.85715 0.41277 0.43418 0.43418 0.02141 0.00473 0.3357 0.1449 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("ods and techniques." 0.14286 0.30821 0.43181 0.45323 0.45323 0.02141 0.00473 0.2540 0.0293 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("The concepts fit into three general types:" 0.14286 0.48115 0.45993 0.48135 0.48135 0.02141 0.00473 0.2841 0.0328 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("1. Concepts about how data science fits in the organization and the competitive land‐" 0.15341 0.85714 0.4941 0.51551 0.51551 0.02141 0.00473 0.3432 0.0147 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 1 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("scape, including ways to attract, structure, and nurture data science teams; ways for" 0.17857 0.85715 0.51315 0.53456 0.53456 0.02141 0.00473 0.3504 0.0497 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("thinking about how data science leads to competitive advantage; and tactical con‐" 0.17856 0.85713 0.53219 0.55361 0.55361 0.02141 0.00473 0.3035 0.0715 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("cepts for doing well with data science projects." 0.17857 0.56436 0.55124 0.57265 0.57265 0.02141 0.00473 0.3152 0.0426 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("2. General ways of thinking data-analytically. These help in identifying appropriate" 0.15341 0.85714 0.57633 0.59775 0.59775 0.02141 0.00473 0.2877 0.0147 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 1 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("data and consider appropriate methods. The concepts include the data mining pro‐" 0.17857 0.85715 0.59538 0.6168 0.61541 0.02141 0.00473 0.3431 0.0352 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
