  ("3. General concepts for actually extracting knowledge from data, which undergird the" 0.1534 0.85714 0.63952 0.66094 0.66094 0.02141 0.00473 0.3556 0.0147 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 1 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("vast array of data science tasks and their algorithms." 0.17857 0.61149 0.65857 0.67998 0.67998 0.02141 0.00473 0.2997 0.0328 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("For example, one fundamental concept is that of determining the similarity of two" 0.14287 0.85715 0.69274 0.71415 0.71415 0.02141 0.00473 0.3139 0.0290 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
