  ("on the unifying concepts, presenting specific tasks and algorithms as natural manifes‐" 0.14285 0.85713 0.09811 0.11952 0.11952 0.02141 0.00473 0.3148 0.0220 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("tations of them." 0.14286 0.27397 0.11716 0.13857 0.13857 0.02141 0.00473 0.3812 0.0567 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("As another example, in evaluating the utility of a pattern, we see a notion of lift— how" 0.14286 0.85724 0.14527 0.16669 0.16531 0.02141 0.00473 0.3733 0.0220 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("much more prevalent a pattern is than would be expected by chance—recurring broadly" 0.14286 0.85715 0.16432 0.18573 0.18573 0.02141 0.00473 0.3748 0.0477 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("across data science. It is used to evaluate very different sorts of patterns in different" 0.14286 0.85714 0.18337 0.20478 0.20478 0.02141 0.00473 0.2241 0.0516 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("contexts. Algorithms for targeting advertisements are evaluated by computing the lift" 0.14285 0.85714 0.20242 0.22383 0.22383 0.02141 0.00473 0.3193 0.0742 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("one gets for the targeted population. Lift is used to judge the weight of evidence for or" 0.14287 0.85715 0.22146 0.24288 0.24288 0.02141 0.00473 0.3053 0.0309 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("against a conclusion. Lift helps determine whether a co-occurrence (an association) in" 0.14286 0.85715 0.24051 0.26193 0.26193 0.02141 0.00473 0.3078 0.0590 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
