  ("We believe that explaining data science around such fundamental concepts not only" 0.14285 0.85714 0.28768 0.30909 0.30909 0.02141 0.00473 0.2817 0.0271 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("aids the reader, it also facilitates communication between business stakeholders and" 0.14285 0.85713 0.30673 0.32814 0.32814 0.02141 0.00473 0.2851 0.0334 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("data scientists. It provides a shared vocabulary and enables both parties to understand" 0.14286 0.85734 0.32577 0.34719 0.34719 0.02141 0.00473 0.2734 0.0352 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("each other better. The shared concepts lead to deeper discussions that may uncover" 0.14286 0.85715 0.34482 0.36623 0.36623 0.02141 0.00473 0.2406 0.0379 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("critical issues otherwise missed." 0.14286 0.40696 0.36387 0.38528 0.38528 0.02141 0.00473 0.3356 0.0573 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("To the Instructor" 0.14287 0.34596 0.40013 0.4344 0.4344 0.03426 0.00593 0.2776 0.0275 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" 0.0286 t nil 0 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" t)
  ("This book has been used successfully as a textbook for a very wide variety of data science" 0.14286 0.85714 0.44089 0.4623 0.4623 0.02141 0.00473 0.3488 0.0372 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
