  ("Data Science classes at the Stern School at NYU, starting in the fall of 2005.^{1} The original" 0.14286 0.85714 0.47898 0.50039 0.50039 0.02141 0.00473 0.3834 0.0396 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
